
mint code
  case form, mint form
    slot form
  case task, mint task
    slot task
  case call, mint call
    slot call
  case hook, mint hook
    slot hook
  case host, mint host
    slot host
  case load, mint load
    slot load
  case dock, mint dock
    slot dock
  case test, mint test
    slot test
  case hold, mint hold
    slot hold
  case suit, mint suit
    slot suit
  case tree, mint tree
    slot tree
